<title>USA: U.S. Trust issues $50 mln trust preferreds.</title>
<headline>U.S. Trust issues $50 mln trust preferreds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Trust Corp on Wednesday said it issued $50 million of 30-year trust preferred capital securities with an interest rate of 8.414 percent in a private placement offering.</p>
<p>The company said it will use the proceeds for general corporate purposes, including the repurchase of common stock.</p>
<p>((--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672))</p>
